# Unicode CLDR, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ha/dateFields.json.
# relative-type--1: "watan da ya gabata", "satin da ya gabata", "Laraba da
# ta gabata", "Asabar da ta wuce".  The marker trails its noun and is the
# same relative clause the counted past uses, so last-week and N-weeks-ago
# are one vocabulary in Hausa.
da ya gabata
da ta gabata
da suka gabata
da ya wuce
da ta wuce
da suka wuce
